      "name": "Leave Request Form",
      "description": "Leave Request for International Student — CP KKU 660301.6.7",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin:0px 0px 12px;text-align:center\"><img src=\"/kkulogo2.png\" alt=\"KKU Logo\" style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif;height:120px;margin:0px auto 8px\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px\">Leave Request for International Student</p><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px\"><p>CP KKU 660301.6.7/<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{doc_number}}\" style=\"--tw-border-spacing-y:0;--tw-translate-x:0;--tw-translate-y:0;--tw-rotate:0;--tw-skew-x:0;--tw-skew-y:0;--tw-scale-x:1;--tw-scale-y:1;--tw-pan-x: ;--tw-pan-y: ;--tw-pinch-zoom: ;--tw-scroll-snap-strictness:proximity;--tw-gradient-from-position: ;--tw-gradient-via-position: ;--tw-gradient-to-position: ;--tw-ordinal: ;--tw-slashed-zero: ;--tw-numeric-figure: ;--tw-numeric-spacing: ;--tw-numeric-fraction: ;--tw-ring-inset: ;--tw-ring-offset-width:0px;--tw-ring-offset-color:#fff;--tw-ring-color:rgba(59,130,246,.5);--tw-ring-offset-shadow:0 0 #0000;--tw-ring-shadow:0 0 #0000;--tw-shadow:0 0 #0000;--tw-shadow-colored:0 0 #0000;--tw-blur: ;--tw-brightness: ;--tw-contrast: ;--tw-grayscale: ;--tw-hue-rotate: ;--tw-invert: ;--tw-saturate: ;--tw-sepia: ;--tw-drop-shadow: ;--tw-backdrop-blur: ;--tw-backdrop-brightness: ;--tw-backdrop-contrast: ;--tw-backdrop-grayscale: ;--tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ;--tw-backdrop-invert: ;--tw-backdrop-opacity: ;--tw-backdrop-saturate: ;--tw-backdrop-sepia: ;--tw-contain-size: ;--tw-contain-layout: ;--tw-contain-paint: ;--tw-contain-style: ;border-width:1px;border-color:rgba(7, 118, 188, 0.2);white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;margin:0px 2px;border-radius:5px;background:rgb(222, 235, 255);color:rgb(7, 118, 188);font-size:11px;font-weight:600\">Document No.</span></p></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px\"><p style=\"text-align:right\">Date <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{date}}\" style=\"display:inline;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);line-height:1;white-space:nowrap\">Current Date</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p></p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">Dear Dean of the College of C</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">omputing, </span><p>I am ....... <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{student_name}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Student Name</span> .......                Student ID no. : ....... <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{student_id}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Student ID</span> <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">.......</span></p><p>Thai Tel. no. :  .......<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{thai_tel}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Thai Tel. No.</span> .......            E-mail : ....... <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{email}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Email</span> <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">.......</span></p><p>Education Level : ....... <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{education_level}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Education Level</span> <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">.......</span></p><p>I am a .......<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{funding_type}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Funding Type</span> ....... (<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{scholarship_name}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Scholarship Name</span>) student in  ....... <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{program}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Program</span> ....... program at the College of Computing, Khon Kaen University.</p><p>I would like to temporarily leave Thailand to visit ....... <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{destination}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Destination City &amp; Country</span> <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">.......</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\"> (the name of the destination city and country) for:</span></p><p><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{purpose}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Purpose of Leave</span></p><p>Duration of leave is  .......<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{duration_days}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Duration (days/months)</span>....... , starting from ...<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{leave_start}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Leave Start Date</span> <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">...</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\"> to </span>...<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{leave_end}}\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif;display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0px 2px;border-radius:5px;background:rgb(222, 235, 255);color:rgb(7, 118, 188);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border-width:1px;border-color:rgba(7, 118, 188, 0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Leave End Date</span>..<span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">.</span></p><p>My visa expires on <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{visa_expiry}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Visa Expiry</span>. <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif\">Re-entry permit: </span><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{re_entry_permit}}\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-sarabun), 'TH Sarabun New', 'Sarabun', sans-serif;display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0px 2px;border-radius:5px;background:rgb(222, 235, 255);color:rgb(7, 118, 188);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border-width:1px;border-color:rgba(7, 118, 188, 0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Re-entry Permit Applied</span></p><p><br /></p><p>*I understand that by taking this leave of absence, I am responsible for complying with all university policies related to leaves and maintaining my student status. I also acknowledge that I must inform the university of any changes to my leave plans.</p><br />",
