    {
      "name": "Report of Arrival for International Student",
      "description": "Submitted within 1 week of returning from an approved leave, with the student ID card, passport arrival stamp page, approved Leave Request and (for research leave) a progress report.",
      "body": "<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\"><img src=\"/kkulogo2.png\" alt=\"KKU Logo\" style=\"height:110px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /></p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;margin:0 0 6px\">Report of Arrival for International Student</p><hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1.5px solid #111;margin:0 0 14px\" /><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:60%;padding:0;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0\">CP KKU 660301.6.7/<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{doc_number}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Document No.</span></p></td><td style=\"width:40%;padding:0;vertical-align:top;text-align:right\"><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0\">Date <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{date}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Current Date</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;margin-top:6px\">Dear Dean of the College of Computing,</p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;margin-top:14px\">In response to the leave request for travelling abroad, CP KKU 660301.6.7/<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{leave_ref_number}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Approved Leave Request No.</span>.</p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0\">I am <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{student_name}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Student Name</span> Student ID no. <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{student_id}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Student ID</span></p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0\">Thai Tel. no. <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{thai_tel}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Thai Tel. No.</span> E-mail <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{email}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Email</span></p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0\">Education Level: <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{education_level}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Education Level</span></p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;text-align:justify\">I am a <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{funding_type}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Funding Type</span> (<span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{scholarship_name}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Scholarship Name</span>) student in <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{program}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Program</span> program at the College of Computing, Khon Kaen University.</p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;text-align:justify\">I would like to inform you about my arrival at Khon Kaen University, Khon Kaen, Thailand, after taking a leave to <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{destination}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Destination City &amp; Country</span> (Name of the country) for: <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{purpose}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Purpose of Leave</span></p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0\">Duration of leave is <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{duration_days}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Duration (days/months)</span> starting from <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{leave_start}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Leave Start Date</span> to <span contenteditable=\"false\" data-var=\"{{leave_end}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:5px;background:#DEEBFF;color:#0776BC;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(7,118,188,0.2);vertical-align:middle;white-space:nowrap\">Leave End Date</span>.</p><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;margin-top:14px\">Enclose herewith are:</p><ol style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;padding-left:2.2em\"><li>A copy of the student ID card</li><li>A copy of the passport page of stamp arrival to Thailand</li><li>A copy of the approved Leave Request for International Student</li><li>Progress report*</li></ol><p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:10px 0 0 2.2em;text-align:justify\">* In case you took a leave for data collection, conference, or research/thesis-related purposes. You need to submit a progress report highlighting the progress you have made, as well as the knowledge and insights you have gained.</p><br />",
      "variables": "[\"{{doc_number}}\",\"{{date}}\",\"{{leave_ref_number}}\",\"{{student_name}}\",\"{{student_id}}\",\"{{thai_tel}}\",\"{{email}}\",\"{{education_level}}\",\"{{funding_type}}\",\"{{scholarship_name}}\",\"{{program}}\",\"{{destination}}\",\"{{purpose}}\",\"{{duration_days}}\",\"{{leave_start}}\",\"{{leave_end}}\",\"{{sig_student}}\"]",
      "signingMethod": "digital",
      "requestTypes": [
        {
          "name": "Report of Arrival",
          "description": "",
          "icon": "RiHome3Line"
        }
      ]
    }
